<title>TURKEY: Turkey debt payments $6.684 billion Jan-Sept 25.</title>
<headline>Turkey debt payments $6.684 billion Jan-Sept 25.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey serviced $659 million of state foreign debt in the period September 2-25, bringing to $6.684 billion total debt payments from January 1 to September 25, the central bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
